02B6   4D                     LD   C,L   
02B7   21 00 00               LD   HL,0   
02BA   CB 21                  SLA   C   
02BC   17                     RLA      
02BD   ED 6A                  ADC   HL,HL   
02BF   ED 52                  SBC   HL,DE   
02C1   30 02                  JR   NC,uvr0   
02C3   19                     ADD   HL,DE   
02C4   0D                     DEC   C   
02C5   0C           UVR0:     INC   C   
02C6   CB 21                  SLA   C   
02C8   17                     RLA      
