034F   ED 52                  SBC   HL,DE   
0351   30 02                  JR   NC,uvr12   
0353   19                     ADD   HL,DE   
0354   0D                     DEC   C   
0355   0C           UVR12:    INC   C   
0356   CB 21                  SLA   C   
0358   17                     RLA      
