046C   17                     RLA      
046D   30 01                  JR   NC,mur6   
046F   19                     ADD   HL,DE   
0470                MUR6:        
0470   29                     ADD   HL,HL   
0471   17                     RLA      
0472   30 01                  JR   NC,mur7   
0474   19                     ADD   HL,DE   
